Decided: one Logs::rotate copies the log to <log>.1 and empties it in place, at start and every 10 minutes, for cooee.log, terminal.log and perf.log
Because: "One rotation function serves all three."
Rejected: renaming the live log — launchd holds cooee.log open from the plist, so writes would follow the renamed file
Decided: farm installs from bytes in the build only when the entry matches the built-in index's farm (url, path, commit); any other index or --rev fetches
Because: q1616
Decided: an index pack is fetched into <data>/themes/<name>/ by git init, sparse-checkout --no-cone /<path>/, fetch --depth 1 --filter=blob:none, checkout FETCH_HEAD
Because: "Each is a shallow clone (`--depth 1`) of only its own folder (sparse checkout)."
Decided: an old <data>/themes/<name>.git is deleted only after its pin's new form is fetched (farm: the build); a pin no longer in the index keeps its old clone
Because: "only once the new form is in place"
Decided: kitchen and garden moved to tests/swag/packs, a fixture in swag's layout; farm moved to packs/farm for the build
Because: "A test installs kitchen from a local swag fixture"
Rejected: making farm a built-in theme like plain — it would change the default for every server with no themes and could not be removed
Check: crates/cooee/tests/themes.rs an_index_pack_is_a_shallow_clone_of_its_folder_alone fails on base (base made a full mirror kitchen.git)
Owner: Logs no longer grow without limit, farm installs offline, and the other themes are small clones, which freed 122 MB on a copy of the mini's data.
